			"notes": "Rewrote the core of the mod to be compatible with Minecraft Version 1.20 and added a new feature\n\n# Supported Minecraft Versions\n- 1.20\n- 1.20.1\n- 1.20.2\n- 1.20.3\n- 1.20.4\n\n#  New Features\n## Preventing Removal of Sign Creator\nWhen ```canRemoveSignCreator``` is set to ```false``` in the config (which it is by default) the first User on the Main Sign (the sign with the ```[Private]``` tag) cannot be removed. This is indicated by underlined text. Note that when locking Containers by hand (not using the autolock feature) the first User you enter should be yourself as that User can't be removed.\n\n<br>\n\n### Remember to backup your world regularly!"
		},
